{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23014","headline":"行次夏口先寄李大夫 · 白居易","name":"行次夏口先寄李大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连山断处大江流，红斾逶迤镇上游。\n幕下翱翔秦御史，军前奔走汉诸侯。\n曾陪劒履升鸾殿，欲谒旌幢入鹤楼。\n假着绯袍君莫笑，恩深始得向忠州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}